// Copy this file to Config/Local.xcconfig (gitignored) to build under your own Apple Developer
// account — e.g. so two people can each have their own build installed on the same test device
// at the same time, or so you can test without touching the shared signing settings.
// The App Group "group.de.goldkunibert.BetterBahn" (widgets) is written out in Config/*.entitlements and
// the Info.plists, since Xcode can't register a group name with a build setting in it; under another
// team, change it there too (locally, don't commit) or the widgets get no data.
LOCAL_DEVELOPMENT_TEAM = YOURTEAMID
LOCAL_BUNDLE_ID_SUFFIX = .yourname
